{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnyVueFormApi = AnyFormApi & VueTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L55","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:55"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Vue form API whose form data and error types are erased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable Vue components that only need core form operations and\nthe "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Field"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayField"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Subscribe"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormGroup"},{"type":"text","value":" components common to\nevery Vue form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VueFormType"},{"type":"text","value":" when a component depends on one known form."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ndefineProps<{ form: AnyVueFormApi }>()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <form.Subscribe\n    :selector=\"(state) => state.isSubmitting\"\n    v-slot=\"isSubmitting\"\n  >\n    <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"isSubmitting\">\n      {{ isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save' }}\n    </button>\n  </form.Subscribe>\n</template>","lang":"vue"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnyVueFormApi = AnyFormApi & VueTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L55)\n\nA Vue form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Vue components that only need core form operations and\nthe `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common to\nevery Vue form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use `VueFormType` when a component depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ndefineProps<{ form: AnyVueFormApi }>()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <form.Subscribe\n    :selector=\"(state) => state.isSubmitting\"\n    v-slot=\"isSubmitting\"\n  >\n    <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"isSubmitting\">\n      {{ isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save' }}\n    </button>\n  </form.Subscribe>\n</template>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnyVueFormApi\ntitle: AnyVueFormApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnyVueFormApi = AnyFormApi & VueTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/vue-form/src/VueForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L55)\n\nA Vue form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Vue components that only need core form operations and\nthe `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common to\nevery Vue form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use `VueFormType` when a component depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ndefineProps<{ form: AnyVueFormApi }>()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <form.Subscribe\n    :selector=\"(state) => state.isSubmitting\"\n    v-slot=\"isSubmitting\"\n  >\n    <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"isSubmitting\">\n      {{ isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save' }}\n    </button>\n  </form.Subscribe>\n</template>\n```\n"}
